    "ogAccent": "6A0DAD",
    "heroCredit": "Toei Animation",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2026-09-02/dragon-ball-super-beerus-anime-new-trailer-unveils-october-11-debut-theme-songs/.241278",
    "trendScore": 88,
    "body": "Dragon Ball's back on TV, and the god of destruction is the headliner. Dragon Ball Super: Beerus premieres October 11 on Fuji TV in Japan, 11:15 p.m. local (10:15 a.m. Eastern), with streaming set to start the same month. The date landed September 2 with a new \"Super Surge\" trailer.\n\n## What the trailer showed\nFresh footage, new characters that look like they widen the story past what we saw in Super, and both theme songs: \"ONOGAMI\" by MEGATERA･ZERO as the opener, \"Kan Peki No Peki\" by VK Blanka as the ending. Toei's putting real money on the screen. It doesn't look like a filler side project.\n\n## Why Beerus\nHe's the best character Super introduced: a cat-shaped god who'll erase your planet over pudding and then take a nap. Making him the center of a series is Toei admitting what fans already knew. The comedy, the power scaling and the cosmic stakes all run through him.\n\n## The New York angle\nEpisode one screens early at the Dragon Ball Super: Beerus panel at New York Comic Con on October 8, three days before Japan. If you're in the city, that's the one panel to fight for.\n\n## Why the 25-45 crowd cares\nThis is the generation that watched Z after school and then watched Super as adults. A new mainline Dragon Ball series is a real event for that audience, the same way a new Jordan retro is. Big name, October date, and a character everybody already loves. Easy call for the board.\n\nOctober 11. Beerus is hungry.\n\n## Sources\n- Anime News Network - Dragon Ball Super: Beerus trailer unveils October 11 debut, theme songs: https://www.animenewsnetwork.com/news/2026-09-02/dragon-ball-super-beerus-anime-new-trailer-unveils-october-11-debut-theme-songs/.241278\n- Cartoon Brew - Dragon Ball Super: Beerus sets October 11 premiere: https://www.cartoonbrew.com/anime/dragon-ball-super-beerus-trailer-premiere-date-266226.html\n- Anime Corner - Beerus trailer previews opening and ending themes: https://animecorner.me/dragon-ball-super-beerus-new-trailer-previews-opening-and-ending-themes-october-11-premiere/",
