    "slug": "gta-6-dualsense-controllers-scalpers-ebay-140-2026",
    "pillar": "gaming",
    "title": "GTA 6 Controllers Are Already Being Flipped for $140",
    "headline": "$84 at Sony.\n$140 on eBay.\nGTA 6 Controllers\nAren't Even Out.",
    "subhead": "Sony's two limited-edition GTA 6 DualSense designs ship November 19. The white one is already out of stock at PlayStation Direct, and resellers are moving preorders at nearly double retail.",
    "description": "GTA 6 limited-edition DualSense controllers ($84 MSRP) are reselling on eBay for about $140 before the Nov 19 ship date. White is sold out at PlayStation Direct.",
    "keywords": [
      "GTA 6 DualSense controller",
      "GTA 6 controller price",
      "GTA 6 controller eBay scalpers",
      "GTA 6 limited edition PS5 accessories",
      "GTA 6 release date November 19",
      "PlayStation Direct GTA 6",
      "GTA 6 preorder",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "$84 AT SONY.\n$140 ON EBAY.",
    "ogAccent": "D9469C",
    "heroCredit": "Sony Interactive Entertainment, via GameSpot",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.gamespot.com/articles/gta-6-dualsense-controller-scalpers-are-already-cashing-in/",
    "heroImage": "https://www.gamespot.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/GTA-6-DualSense.jpg",
    "trendScore": 80,
    "body": "Sixty-eight days out from GTA 6, the resale market has already started. [GameSpot](https://www.gamespot.com/articles/gta-6-dualsense-controller-scalpers-are-already-cashing-in/) reported Friday that the two limited-edition GTA 6 DualSense controllers, listed by Sony at $84 each, are selling on eBay for an average of around $140 per completed sale. They don't ship until November 19, launch day. People are paying nearly double for a preorder receipt.\n\n## What's actually for sale\nSony unveiled two designs: a color-shifting finish and a version with palm trees molded into the controller body. At PlayStation Direct, the white limited edition is out of stock. The black one was still available for preorder as of Friday. There's no GTA 6-themed PS5 console announced yet; the only limited consoles Sony has put out this fall are the two Marvel's Wolverine editions.\n\n## The rule eBay isn't enforcing\neBay's own policy says presale listings have to guarantee shipment within 40 business days of purchase. November 19 is well past that window for anything sold in September. GameSpot's read is that the listings break the terms of service and eBay isn't doing anything about it. That's the 2021 console-shortage playbook running again, after the 25th-anniversary Xbox Series X sold out in a minute and the Zelda Switch 2 went the same way.\n\n## Why the controllers are moving\nThe game is the biggest launch in the history of the medium, and the merch around it is scarce by design. Rockstar and Sony are treating the accessories like a sneaker drop: limited runs, no restock promise, a date months out. A $140 controller is a bet that the white one never comes back. It probably won't. But paying scalper prices in September for something Sony hasn't finished selling in the first place is how you fund the next round of bots.\n\n## The practical advice\nCheck PlayStation Direct for the black model before you touch a resale listing. Retailers like Best Buy, GameStop and Walmart typically get their own allocation closer to ship date, and Sony hasn't said those are gone. Preload for the game itself opens November 12; physical copies ship with a download code and no disc, which is its own story. The controller isn't required for any of it.\n\n## Sources\n- GameSpot, September 11, 2026 - GTA 6 DualSense Controller Scalpers Are Already Cashing In: https://www.gamespot.com/articles/gta-6-dualsense-controller-scalpers-are-already-cashing-in/\n- GameSpot - GTA 6 limited edition DualSense controllers are on the way: https://www.gamespot.com/articles/gta-6-limited-edition-dualsense-controllers-are-on-the-way-and-they-look-fantastic/\n- PlayStation Direct - DualSense Wireless Controller, Grand Theft Auto VI Black Limited Edition: https://direct.playstation.com/en-us/buy-accessories/dualsense-wireless-controller-grand-theft-auto-vi-black-limited-edition-for-ps5-pc-mac-mobile\n",
