    "title": "Aizen Is Back: Bleach TYBW Episode 48 Airs Today",
    "headline": "Ichigo's Bankai Is Broken.\nAizen Walks In.\nBleach Episode 48.",
    "subhead": "'The Calamity' hits its eighth episode September 12 on Hulu in the U.S. and Disney+ abroad. The preview puts Sosuke Aizen back on screen as Yhwach heads for the Seireitei.",
    "description": "Bleach: Thousand-Year Blood War Part 4 Episode 8 (Episode 48 overall) premieres Sept 12, 2026 on Hulu and Disney+. The preview shows Aizen back as Yhwach moves.",
    "keywords": [
      "Bleach TYBW episode 48",
      "Bleach Thousand-Year Blood War Part 4",
      "Bleach The Calamity episode 8",
      "Aizen returns Bleach",
      "Bleach episode 48 release date",
      "Bleach TYBW Hulu",
      "Yhwach Seireitei",
      "Tite Kubo anime original content",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "AIZEN WALKS IN.\nBLEACH EPISODE 48.",
    "ogAccent": "8B0000",
    "heroCredit": "Tite Kubo/Shueisha, TV TOKYO, dentsu, Pierrot, via Anime Corner",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://animecorner.me/aizen-is-back-in-bleach-thousand-year-blood-war-episode-48-preview/",
    "heroImage": "https://static.animecorner.me/2026/09/1789124510-84c9b95d43d2e8494c32169b49f67dcd.jpg",
    "trendScore": 82,
    "body": "If you were in a school hallway in 2006 arguing about Bankai, this is the episode you've been waiting two decades for. Bleach: Thousand-Year Blood War Part 4, subtitled The Calamity, drops its eighth episode on Saturday, September 12. It's Episode 48 in the full count. [Anime Corner](https://animecorner.me/aizen-is-back-in-bleach-thousand-year-blood-war-episode-48-preview/) ran the preview Friday, and the images show exactly who you think they show: Sosuke Aizen, out of the chair.\n\n## Where the story sits\nThe official synopsis: Uryu slammed Wahrwelt's central island into the \"Distortion\" and wiped both out. It didn't matter. Yhwach has reclaimed every Schrift and pushed The Almighty past the point where he needs the Distortion at all. He announces he'll destroy the Seireitei as one last amusement and vanishes. Ichigo's Bankai is shattered, his Zanpakuto broken, and he can't stand. Then, per the synopsis, \"men with whom he had once crossed swords\" appear in front of him.\n\nManga readers know who walks through that door. Anime-only viewers get the payoff today.\n\n## The staff on this one\nScript by Masaki Hiramatsu. Storyboard and episode direction by Shinichiro Ueda. Chief animation director Kiyomi Komatsubara, with animation directors Manamu Amasaki, Natsuko Suzuki, Izumi Kondo, Kazuo Takigawa and Mika Okubo. Pierrot has been treating Part 4 as the final statement on the series, and Tite Kubo said before the premiere that this cour has more original material than any previous part, expanding fights the manga rushed.\n\n## Where and when to watch\nPart 4 premiered July 25 and runs ten episodes, so today is episode eight of ten. In the U.S., Hulu carries Thousand-Year Blood War; outside the U.S. it's on Disney+ in most territories. Note that Japanese streaming for several platforms moved to Tuesdays starting with episode 47, so if your usual source lags, that's why.\n\n## Why Bleach lands with this audience\nBleach was the third leg of the Big Three with Naruto and One Piece for anyone who came up on Toonami and Adult Swim. The 2012 anime ended before the manga did, and fans waited a decade to see the final arc drawn properly. Thousand-Year Blood War is that arc, and Aizen returning to face Yhwach is the moment the whole run has been building toward. Two episodes left after this one.\n\n## Sources\n- Anime Corner, September 11, 2026 - Aizen Is Back in BLEACH: Thousand-Year Blood War Episode 48 Preview: https://animecorner.me/aizen-is-back-in-bleach-thousand-year-blood-war-episode-48-preview/\n- Anime Corner, September 5, 2026 - BLEACH: Thousand-Year Blood War Episode 47 Streaming Delayed as Schedule Moves to Tuesdays for Numerous Platforms in Japan: https://animecorner.me/bleach-thousand-year-blood-war-episode-47-streaming-delayed-as-schedule-moves-to-tuesdays-for-numerous-platforms-in-japan/\n- GamesRadar+ - Bleach Thousand-Year Blood War season 4 release schedule (Disney Plus and Hulu): https://www.gamesradar.com/entertainment/anime-shows/bleach-thousand-year-blood-war-season-4-release-date-time-schedule-disney-plus-hulu/\n- BLEACH: Thousand-Year Blood War official site - Story: https://bleach-anime.com/story/\n",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-12",
    "goLiveAt": "2026-09-12",
    "heroFocus": "center"
