    "trendScore": 70,
    "body": "Nike has been late to Halloween for years. Not this year. The Air Jordan 1 Low \"Halloween\" got its official images Thursday, September 11, via [Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/11/air-jordan-1-low-halloween-black-green-iq5494-001/) (@sneakernews), and it's the general-release entry in a stack that already includes the [Jordan 5 \"Halloween\"](https://sneakernews.com/2026/08/21/air-jordan-5-halloween-hq7978-001/) on October 17.\n\n## The build\n\nIQ5494-001. Black nubuck and leather base, neon green trim everywhere it counts: an \"XXIII\" stitch toward the toe, \"raw leather\" edges around each panel, and a glow-in-the-dark outsole. The 23 stitching is the detail, small enough to wear past November, loud enough to read under a blacklight. It threads the needle between a holiday shoe and an everyday black 1 Low, which is the whole trick with these.\n\n![Air Jordan 1 Low \"Halloween\" lateral](https://sneakernews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/air-jordan-1-low-halloween-black-green-IQ5494-001-7.jpg \"Sneaker News|https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/11/air-jordan-1-low-halloween-black-green-iq5494-001/\")\n\n![Air Jordan 1 Low \"Halloween\" detail](https://sneakernews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/air-jordan-1-low-halloween-black-green-IQ5494-001-3.jpg \"Sneaker News|https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/11/air-jordan-1-low-halloween-black-green-iq5494-001/\")\n\n## The spooky slate\n\nJordan Brand previewed the 5 \"Halloween\" at its [New York Fashion Week holiday suite](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/10/jordan-brand-holiday-2026-preview-nyfw/) this week: black upper, red-orange accents, glow sole, October 17. Nike Basketball has the Book 2 and Ja 4 in Halloween colorways, and the lifestyle side has an Air Force 1 \"Scream\" for mid-October. The 1 Low is the cheapest way into the group and the only one that isn't a hype pair, which is exactly why it'll sit on shelves and then quietly sell through.\n\n## Buy notes\n\nExpected mid-October, $125, men's sizing. No firm date yet. The [SneakerNews Jordan release calendar](https://sneakernews.com/air-jordan-release-dates/) will post the store list when Nike locks it.\n\n## Sources\n- [The Air Jordan 1 Low Gets Spooky With A \"Halloween\" Colorway](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/11/air-jordan-1-low-halloween-black-green-iq5494-001/) — Sneaker News (@sneakernews), Sept. 11, 2026\n- [Here's What Jordan Brand Previewed At New York Fashion Week](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/10/jordan-brand-holiday-2026-preview-nyfw/) — Sneaker News, Sept. 10, 2026\n",
