    "ogHeadline": "SPORT BLUE 6S.\nFALL 2027.",
    "ogAccent": "1F5FBF",
    "heroCredit": "Sole Retriever",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.soleretriever.com/news/articles/air-jordan-6-retro-sport-blue-release-date-fall-2027",
    "trendScore": 66,
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "body": "The 6 is the shoe Mike won his first ring in, and Sport Blue is the pair everybody forgets until it comes back. It's coming back.\n\n## The report\n[Sole Retriever](https://www.soleretriever.com/news/articles/air-jordan-6-retro-sport-blue-release-date-fall-2027) published the fall 2027 window on September 11, sourcing zSneakerHeadz and Sneaker Files. Price and style code aren't out. Jordan Brand hasn't said a word, so file this under reported, not confirmed. The leaker track record on these 2027 windows has been solid this year, but a window can move a full season.\n\n## What's supposed to be different\nTwo things. The 2014 retro ran a Jumpman on the heel; the 2027 pair is said to bring back the Nike Air, the same fix Jordan Brand has been rolling through the 4 Bred, the 3 and the 9 this year. And the shape gets reworked toward the 1991 original: lower collar, tighter toe, the way the 6 looked when it was on the court and not on a shelf.\n\n## Where it sits in the 2027 slate\nFall 2027 already has the 4 Fire Red in OG shape and the 10 Knicks getting its first retro. Add a Sport Blue 6 with Nike Air and you have three OG-accuracy retros in one season, which is a strategy, not a coincidence. Jordan Brand is answering a soft resale summer by making the shoes right instead of making more of them.\n\n## The take\nWhite leather, black tongue, Sport Blue on the heel tab and the Jumpman. It was never the loudest 6. It's the one you wear with everything. A year out, the only question is whether they keep it at general release or make it the chase.\n\n## Sources\n- Sole Retriever, Sept. 11, 2026 — Air Jordan 6 Retro 'Sport Blue' release date, fall 2027: https://www.soleretriever.com/news/articles/air-jordan-6-retro-sport-blue-release-date-fall-2027\n- Just Fresh Kicks, Sept. 14, 2026 — Air Jordan 4 'Fire Red' releases fall 2027 (context on the 2027 OG slate): https://justfreshkicks.com/\n"
