    "ogHeadline": "BO7 SEASON 06:\nDOOM x THE HAUNTING",
    "ogAccent": "FF6A00",
    "heroImage": "https://imgs.callofduty.com/content/dam/atvi/callofduty/cod-touchui/blog/body/bo7/season-06/BO7-SEASON-06-ANNOUNCEMENT-TOUT-1.jpg",
    "heroCredit": "Activision",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/09/call-of-duty-black-ops-7-warzone-season-6-the-haunting-announcement",
    "trendScore": 82,
    "body": "The Haunting is Call of Duty's Halloween season, and this year it brought the Doom Slayer.\n\n## When\nSeason 06 goes live Thursday, Sept. 17 at 9 a.m. PT across *Black Ops 7* and *Warzone*, per the [PlayStation Blog](https://blog.playstation.com/2026/09/08/call-of-duty-black-ops-7-and-warzone-season-06-launches-the-haunting-september-17/) and [Activision's own announcement](https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/09/call-of-duty-black-ops-7-warzone-season-6-the-haunting-announcement) on Sept. 8.\n\n!youtube(https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=loeFxc7AyrY)\n\n## The DOOM piece\nA DOOM Event Pass and a Tracer Pack: Doom Demonic Essence Bundle bring id Software's hell into the shooter that spent twenty years trying not to be a monster game. It's the biggest crossover the franchise has done with another Microsoft-owned property since the acquisition, and it makes sense: both games are about the same thing, which is moving fast and killing everything.\n\n## Warzone\nHaunted Hollow is a nighttime version of the map with a Ghost Train, trick-or-treat pumpkins and a drained pond that exposes ruins underneath. The headliner mode is Giant Infected: 64 players, 8 start Infected, and Survivors have to build a DNA Bomb to win. That's Infected at a scale the franchise has never tried.\n\n## Multiplayer\nNew map Quantum, set in an Arctic quantum-computing facility, plus a rethemed Bloodstead. Two limited-time modes: T.E.D.D. Trials, which brings three Zombies maps (Roadkill, Inferno, Lost) into multiplayer for the first time, and Hordepoint. Battle Pass weapons are the VMP SMG and TR51 Para AR; the Arcblade melee and Roc 20mm Special come through events and challenges. BlackCell adds the Revenant operator. The Pass's headline character is Blackjack.\n\n![Black Ops 7 Season 06 The Haunting key art](https://blog.playstation.com/tachyon/2026/09/18e581351f2ed2273a5e97ea892561e8f5b92937.jpg \"Activision via PlayStation Blog|https://blog.playstation.com/2026/09/08/call-of-duty-black-ops-7-and-warzone-season-06-launches-the-haunting-september-17/\")\n\n## Zombies\nNew Survival map Tenshu, a Rex Infernus Directed Mode and Starting Room, Rogue Run additions including Pack-a-Punch IV and Golden Armor, pumpkin-headed zombies, and a Super Easter Egg that unlocks for players who've finished every Main Quest. That last one is Treyarch rewarding the people who've been grinding since November.\n\n## What's next\nCall of Duty Next returns Sept. 30 with reveals for *BO7*, *Warzone* and *CoD Mobile*, per [TechRadar](https://www.techradar.com/gaming/call-of-duty-next-start-date). That's historically where the next year's game gets its first real look, so The Haunting has about two weeks to own the conversation before it gets stepped on.\n\n## Sources\n- PlayStation Blog, Sept. 8, 2026, Black Ops 7 and Warzone Season 06 launches The Haunting Sept. 17: https://blog.playstation.com/2026/09/08/call-of-duty-black-ops-7-and-warzone-season-06-launches-the-haunting-september-17/\n- Call of Duty Blog, Sept. 8, 2026, Season 06 The Haunting announcement: https://www.callofduty.com/blog/2026/09/call-of-duty-black-ops-7-warzone-season-6-the-haunting-announcement\n- TechRadar, Sept. 2026, Call of Duty Next start date: https://www.techradar.com/gaming/call-of-duty-next-start-date\n",
