    "headline": "Memphis Lost\nOne of Its Architects.",
    "subhead": "CEO Grip, a business partner in Collective Music Group and a longtime figure beside Yo Gotti, died this week. Boosie, Moneybagg Yo, 42 Dugg and YFN Lucci led the tributes. No cause has been announced.",
