    "trendScore": 76,
    "body": "Every brown-and-gum Jordan 3 for the rest of time gets compared to the Travis Scott pair. This one invites it on purpose.\n\n## The official photos\n[Sneaker Bar Detroit](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-3-fireside-ck9246-200/) posted official photos via JD Sports UK on Sept. 19. Air Jordan 3 WMNS \"Fireside,\" CK9246-200, Velvet Brown / Light British Tan / Rust Pink / Pearl White. Tumbled leather on the main panels, suede on the tongue, collar and lacing, elephant print at toe and heel pushed tonal into the brown so it reads as texture rather than contrast. Pearl white Jumpman and heel branding. Dark brown midsole over a gum light brown outsole. Pale pink replacement laces in the box.\n\n![Air Jordan 3 WMNS Fireside, official photo](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/air-jordan-3-fireside-ck9246-200-2.webp \"JD Sports UK via Sneaker Bar Detroit|https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-3-fireside-ck9246-200/\")\n\n## Release\nOct. 3, 2026, women's sizing. SBD lists $205; [Nice Kicks](https://www.nicekicks.com/air-jordan-3-wmns-fireside-ck9246-200/) has $215, so one of them is off. The [Sneaker News calendar](https://sneakernews.com/air-jordan-release-dates/) shows a wide retailer list: SNKRS, Foot Locker, Finish Line, JD Sports, Concepts, Extra Butter, SNS, TAKOUT NY and Nordstrom. It's part of the same Fireside family as the [AJ12 \"Fireside\"](https://sneakzandbeatz.com/the-lane/air-jordan-12-fireside-ct8013-105-october-24-official-look-2026) landing Oct. 24.\n\n![Air Jordan 3 WMNS Fireside, heel](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/air-jordan-3-fireside-ck9246-200-5.webp \"JD Sports UK via Sneaker Bar Detroit|https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-3-fireside-ck9246-200/\")\n\n## The comparison\nSBD makes it directly, and they're right: a brown 3 with tonal elephant print and gum reads as Cactus Jack from ten feet. The differences are the pink accents, the pearl white branding instead of the reverse Swoosh, and about $1,000 on the resale market. Jordan Brand has spent three years quietly releasing GR colorways that borrow the collab palette; the \"Fireside\" is the cleanest one yet on the 3.\n\n## The read\nA women's-sizing GR that gives the Travis look at retail is the most useful sneaker release of the first week of October, and it will get slept on because it isn't a collab. Men who wear up to a women's 12 know what to do. Everyone else, the 12 \"Fireside\" is three weeks later.\n\n## Sources\n- Sneaker Bar Detroit, Sept. 19, 2026, Air Jordan 3 WMNS \"Fireside\" CK9246-200 official photos: https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-3-fireside-ck9246-200/\n- Nice Kicks, Air Jordan 3 WMNS \"Fireside\": https://www.nicekicks.com/air-jordan-3-wmns-fireside-ck9246-200/\n- Sneaker News Jordan release calendar, Oct. 3 entry: https://sneakernews.com/air-jordan-release-dates/\n",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-20",
