    "slug": "ski-mask-the-slump-god-broward-dui-arrest-11-counts-not-that-serious-september-17-2026",
    "pillar": "hiphop",
    "title": "Ski Mask Says the Broward DUI Is 'Not That Serious.' The Booking Sheet Says Eleven Counts.",
    "headline": "Ski Mask: 'Not That Serious.'\nBroward Says Eleven Counts.",
    "subhead": "Ski Mask The Slump God was booked into Broward County Main Jail on Sept. 17 after a Florida Highway Patrol stop. He answered from his couch Saturday night with the fights on: 'I barely tapped one person.' The record lists four damage counts on each side.",
    "description": "Ski Mask The Slump God arrested Sept. 17 in Broward on an 11-count DUI sheet, ~$9K bond, then shrugs it off on IG: 'Not that serious.' What the record says.",
    "keywords": [
      "Ski Mask The Slump God",
      "Stokeley Goulbourne",
      "Ski Mask DUI arrest",
      "Broward County arrest",
      "Florida Highway Patrol",
      "Fort Lauderdale rapper",
      "Members Only",
      "XXXTentacion",
      "No Jumper",
      "Catch Me Outside",
      "BreakTheRules",
      "Very Rare",
      "Empire Distribution",
      "Sneakz and Beatz",
      "PHRHX",
      "Black-owned media"
    ],
    "ogHeadline": "SKI MASK: 'NOT THAT SERIOUS.'\nBROWARD: ELEVEN COUNTS.",
    "ogAccent": "0B3D2E",
    "heroImage": "https://images.complex.com/complex/image/upload/c_crop,h_1782,w_3498,x_0,y_21/g_auto:aoi_900_152_700_356,ar_1.91,c_fill,q_auto,w_1200/sanity-new/ncnxajsz8fv6ak7gs6jx",
    "heroCredit": "Barry Brecheisen / Getty Images via Complex",
    "heroCreditUrl": "https://www.complex.com/music/a/treyalston/ski-mask-slump-god-dui-arrest-broward",
    "heroFocus": "center",
    "trendScore": 84,
    "body": "The mugshot moved faster than the charge sheet. By the time most of the timeline saw Ski Mask The Slump God's Broward County booking photo, he was already on his Instagram story with the fights on in the background telling everybody to relax. The paperwork says relax is a stretch.\n\n## What happened\nPer [Complex](https://www.complex.com/music/a/treyalston/ski-mask-slump-god-dui-arrest-broward), Florida Highway Patrol pulled Ski (Stokeley Clevon Goulbourne, 30) over on Thursday, September 17, and booked him into Broward County Main Jail the same day. Bond came in just under $9,000. The photo started circulating over the weekend, and [@nojumper](https://x.com/nojumper) is the account that pushed it wide, first on X and then with the [IG post](https://www.instagram.com/p/Ddg6bEIFe0x/) where the comment section split into \"take this serious\" and \"it's Ski, it's fine.\" [HotNewHipHop](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1010442-ski-mask-the-slump-god-speaks-out-florida-dui-arrest) matched it Sunday, September 20.\n\n## The charge sheet\nThis is where the \"not that serious\" line runs into arithmetic. The [Broward booking record](https://recentlybooked.com/fl/broward/stokeley-goulbourne~6_272600592), reviewed by [Hoodline](https://hoodline.com/2026/09/ski-mask-the-slump-god-booked-on-11-counts-in-broward-dui-crash/), lists eleven counts: one first-offense DUI, four DUI-with-damage counts (property or person), one first-offense reckless driving, four reckless-driving-with-damage counts, and one charge of driving without a valid license. Complex summarizes it as five DUI counts, four reckless, one license, so call it ten or eleven depending on how you stack the first-offense lines; either way, four separate damage counts on each side means the state is saying more than one thing got hit. Every DUI-with-damage count is a first-degree misdemeanor in Florida, up to 12 months and $1,000 apiece under [statute 316.193](https://mayersohnlaw.com/dui-with-property-damage-felony-charges-explained/). Nobody is going to do the max on a stack like this, but Broward is not a county that consolidates traffic counts out of courtesy. No court date has been reported yet.\n\n## His version\nSaturday night, September 19, with UFC 331 on, Ski posted the response that's now the headline everywhere. \"I'm literally at home watching the fights,\" he said. \"It's not that serious. I barely tapped one person. I got out to check on him. Nobody was hurt.\" He also said it happened at four in the morning, which is a detail his lawyer probably wishes he'd kept. Read it for what it is: a Fort Lauderdale kid who's been through a juvenile detention center, a Members Only run with [XXXTentacion](https://www.complex.com/music/a/eric-skelton/ski-mask-the-slump-god-xxxtentacion-take-a-step-back), a platinum single and a No. 6 debut album, and who is now treating an eleven-count booking like a fender bender. That's on brand. It's also exactly the kind of clip a prosecutor screenshots.\n\n![Ski Mask The Slump God's Instagram story response, Sept. 19](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/imgprst/2292x1200-fit-81-auto/2026/09/Ski-Mask-The-Slump-God-Speaks-Out-Florida-DUI-Arrest.jpg \"Instagram @theslumpgod via HotNewHipHop|https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1010442-ski-mask-the-slump-god-speaks-out-florida-dui-arrest\")\n\n## Why this reads bigger than a DUI\nTwo reasons. First, the timing: Ski has been quiet all year outside of [\"BreakTheRules!\"](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/987253-breaktherules-ski-mask-the-slump-god) in April and a steady drip of new-album teases, and the first big news cycle of his 2026 is a mugshot. He'll get it back, but the rollout now starts from a court docket instead of a single. Second, the pattern: [BigXthaPlug](https://www.complex.com/music/a/treyalston/bigxthaplug-arrested-texas-dwi-drug-gun-charges) took a DWI-plus-gun booking in Collin County last month, and [NBA YoungBoy's](https://www.complex.com/music/a/will-lavin/nba-youngboy-reckless-driving-arrest-bodycam) reckless-driving bodycam went viral in July. Southern rap's summer legal news has been traffic stops, and the labels (Ski is on Empire) are watching their artists turn routine stops into content. Ski's move was to make the content himself before the blogs could. That's the Florida reflex: control the joke before it controls you.\n\n!youtube(https://youtu.be/g0KJowgoeT4)\n\n## The read\nThe thing to watch isn't the misdemeanors. It's whether \"barely tapped one person\" holds up once the crash report is public, because four damage counts and one tapped person don't describe the same morning. If there's a second vehicle or an injury claim in that report, the story stops being a shrug on an IG story. If there isn't, he's right, this blows over, and we'll be talking about the album. Either way, the mugshot is out, the clip is out, and Ski chose the fights over a lawyer's statement. Very Rare, indeed.\n\n## Sources\n- [Ski Mask the Slump God Shrugs Off Florida DUI Arrest: 'It's Not That Serious'](https://www.complex.com/music/a/treyalston/ski-mask-slump-god-dui-arrest-broward) — Complex, Sept. 20, 2026\n- [Ski Mask The Slump God Speaks Out After Florida DUI Arrest](https://www.hotnewhiphop.com/1010442-ski-mask-the-slump-god-speaks-out-florida-dui-arrest) — HotNewHipHop, Sept. 20, 2026\n- [Ski Mask the Slump God Booked on 11 Counts in Broward DUI Crash](https://hoodline.com/2026/09/ski-mask-the-slump-god-booked-on-11-counts-in-broward-dui-crash/) — Hoodline Miami, Sept. 21, 2026\n- [Broward County booking record: Stokeley Goulbourne](https://recentlybooked.com/fl/broward/stokeley-goulbourne~6_272600592) — Recently Booked, Sept. 17, 2026\n- [@nojumper — Ski Mask arrest post + response](https://www.instagram.com/p/Ddg6bEIFe0x/) — Instagram, Sept. 20, 2026\n- [Ski Mask The Slump God - BreakTheRules! (Official Video)](https://youtu.be/g0KJowgoeT4) — YouTube / @theslumpgod, Apr. 3, 2026\n",
