    "headline": "Free Emulator Week:\nThree Grails, Zero Dollars",
    "subhead": "September 21 was a bumper day for free hardware emulators: an open-source Yamaha FS1R, a Nord Modular G1 running its real OS, and Joe Landers' Korg Prophecy, all alpha, all free. What a producer should actually download.",
    "description": "Three free synth emulators in a day: Musica.Studio FSVR (Yamaha FS1R), Animatek G1-Emu (Nord Modular G1), Profligacy (Korg Prophecy). A producer's guide.",
