    "body": "Jordan Brand's all-black holiday set is complete. The 16 was the last one hiding, and Sneaker News got the first look Monday night.\n\n## The shoe\nFull-grain pebbled leather across the upper, glossy patent on the toe box, the removable gaiter that made the 16 the weirdest shoe of the post-Bulls era, and not a single color anywhere. Style code IZ2586-001. Sneaker News' comparison is right: this is a richer execution than a flat Black Cat 4, because the 16 was always half dress shoe. ([Sneaker News](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/21/air-jordan-16-black-pack-iz2586-001/))\n\n## The pack\nFour models, all from the post-Bulls years: Air Jordan 14 Low, 15, 16 and 17 Low, each in its own black materials. The other three surfaced over the summer; the 16 completes the set. Holiday '26 across the board.\n\n## The date and the door\nThe 16 is expected October 3, $245, at NBHD (neighborhood) retailers, not SNKRS. That's the important line. NBHD drops mean your local boutique, not the app, and it means Jordan Brand is treating the 16 as a shop-floor shoe. Eleven days from Tuesday. [Sneaker Bar Detroit](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-16-black-pack/) has the same window.\n\n## The read\nThis is the \"reset\" year in one collection. The Space Jam 11 is the December headline; the Black Cat 5 is 2027's. In between, a quiet black pack of the shoes MJ wore after Chicago, priced like retros, sold at the stores that still carry them. If you missed the 16 in 2001 and 2016, this is the cleanest one yet.\n\n## Sources\n- [First look at the Air Jordan 16 \"Black Pack\"](https://sneakernews.com/2026/09/21/air-jordan-16-black-pack-iz2586-001/) — Sneaker News, Sept. 21, 2026\n- [Air Jordan 16 \"Black Pack\" releases October 2026](https://sneakerbardetroit.com/air-jordan-16-black-pack/) — Sneaker Bar Detroit, Sept. 2026\n- [Air Jordan \"Black Pack\" overview](https://sneakernews.com/2026/06/23/air-jordan-black-pack/) — Sneaker News, June 23, 2026\n",
